# The old local WOLF v3 copy (moved to the central archive on 2026-10-09). Anchored
# to the repository root, because an unanchored "Wolf/" also matches
# .claude/skills/wolf/ on case-insensitive file systems and hides the wolf skill.
/Wolf/

# Subscriber backups (npm run backup). Personal data: never commit. A test proves this rule holds.
/backups/

